Catalan translation. Scope: insight-prose templates, garment labels, clothes-rule
editor, outfit-card labels, and region/voice-locale picker names. Tone is
informal "tu"-form throughout ("Posa't …", "Emporta't …"), matching the
existing Spanish prose register. Time format uses ":" rather than "h" since
the in-app clock is digit-driven and reads consistently across locales.
-->
